-- Benchmark WOD seed (the canonical "Girls" + selected "Heroes").
-- Body shapes are validated by @rallypoint/fitness-shared's wodBodySchema
-- at the route layer; this seed is read-only and only inserted from here.
-- timeCapS on For Time WODs is conservative (advisory) — the live UI shows
-- it but doesn't force-DNF until the user hits Finish.
